{"4885270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Backrooms: A Way Out", "steam_appid": 4885270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a collection of unsettling, eerie and liminal spaces inspired by the Backrooms. while actively trying to find a way out for your survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/9db388d94bdce657380690a8577487a8.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This game is currently in development and is not a full release. More information about the game can be found in the Discord server. </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/0ce5fc14af108c18af41cc18c321d471.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a team of up to 2-6 players and explore the Backrooms together. Cooperation is essential in order to survive. Make sure to communicate with your teammates and beware of the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/e44d5c031eb244cb55900c9a1093e8d4.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will offer multiples different game modes for different playstyles. The standard mode contains hostile entities and higher difficulty designed to create a survival focused experience. If you want a simpler and friendly, but still eerie difficulty, a &quot;liminal&quot; mode removes entities and threats, allowing the exploration of environments, whether just for the vibes, or the layout of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/bae7878a49e964242b766043dbacd994.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore up to multiple distinct levels. Each inspired by Backrooms lore. Each level will be hand crafted in order to create an immersive and eerie feeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/3e50cea2284865ba8da28b84e045fe5f.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself inside the backrooms with teammates with built-in proximity voice chat, allowing for communications inside the levels. Be careful, as some environments might need you to be silent, so make sure to keep an eye out. Or don't.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/08dc17c74beb7252f119cc93efffe070.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has their own entities from the Backrooms, each entity is different so make sure to adapt in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/eb4bacca50e449fc1bb8521eba4aa83f.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will receive content updates such as new levels, bug fixes, and more, all on Steam and for free after purchase. Includes free seasonal events/updates. No paid DLC. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/b076f056a6fce0a0e13bef559d688593.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BAWO is an indie project developed by only EricTMN, so any support is appreciated, whether it is word of mouth, donations, videos of the game, or etc. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a collection of unsettling, eerie and liminal spaces inspired by the Backrooms. while actively trying to find a way out for your survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/9db388d94bdce657380690a8577487a8.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This game is currently in development and is not a full release. More information about the game can be found in the Discord server. </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/0ce5fc14af108c18af41cc18c321d471.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a team of up to 2-6 players and explore the Backrooms together. Cooperation is essential in order to survive. Make sure to communicate with your teammates and beware of the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/e44d5c031eb244cb55900c9a1093e8d4.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will offer multiples different game modes for different playstyles. The standard mode contains hostile entities and higher difficulty designed to create a survival focused experience. If you want a simpler and friendly, but still eerie difficulty, a &quot;liminal&quot; mode removes entities and threats, allowing the exploration of environments, whether just for the vibes, or the layout of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/bae7878a49e964242b766043dbacd994.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore up to multiple distinct levels. Each inspired by Backrooms lore. Each level will be hand crafted in order to create an immersive and eerie feeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/3e50cea2284865ba8da28b84e045fe5f.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself inside the backrooms with teammates with built-in proximity voice chat, allowing for communications inside the levels. Be careful, as some environments might need you to be silent, so make sure to keep an eye out. Or don't.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/08dc17c74beb7252f119cc93efffe070.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has their own entities from the Backrooms, each entity is different so make sure to adapt in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/eb4bacca50e449fc1bb8521eba4aa83f.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will receive content updates such as new levels, bug fixes, and more, all on Steam and for free after purchase. Includes free seasonal events/updates. No paid DLC. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/extras/b076f056a6fce0a0e13bef559d688593.avif?t=1788136662\" alt=\"\"width=1500 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BAWO is an indie project developed by only EricTMN, so any support is appreciated, whether it is word of mouth, donations, videos of the game, or etc. </p>", "short_description": "Backrooms: A Way Out is a 1-6 online multiplayer co-op horror game. Explore eerie and liminal levels, all inspired by the Backrooms, whilst avoiding dangerous hazards and entities. Will you find a way out of the backrooms, or will you find that you are trapped with no way out?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/a7db4930d62845c5f1c7ba336c016aa05cfb37c7/header.jpg?t=1788136662", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/a5c584051684f8163977e1f5d11d059b60ebaea9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788136662", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885270/a5c584051684f8163977e1f5d11d059b60ebaea9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788136662", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 5700G with Radeon Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA 